      "id": "compute-render-zero-copy",
      "owner": "Nexus Compute/Render interop + PrehistoricRush render provider",
      "status": "DOCUMENTED",
      "detail": "PrehistoricRush production rendering is still Three/WebGL2. WebGPU Compute can be preferred when available, but GPU-resident Compute outputs cannot be handed directly to the WebGL2 renderer without a readback/copy. A true zero-copy path requires a compatible WebGPU Render provider/resource interop boundary."
